Hi,

I've applied most of my pending patches to CVS HEAD.
The changes are fairly big amount, so if you have your patches, please
try to sync with the current CVS tree again (after anon cvs tree is
synced).

Some drivers (e.g. emu10k1) have newly the suspend/resume support
experimentally.  If you have such ones, check it out.  See
ALSA-Configuration.txt if your device is supported.

Note that currently the compilation with 2.2/2.4 kernels may fail due
to lack of bitmap.h.  I'll add workarounds later.


Takashi


